  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "67e2d054-58a2-4537-a13a-f1595fcb7e30",
      "name": "\ud83d\udccb Overview & Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -128,
        32
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 500,
        "height": 740,
        "content": "## \ud83e\uddfe Vendor Invoice Duplicate Payment Blocker\n\nStops finance teams from paying the same invoice twice. Every invoice is fingerprinted and checked against a paid-invoice register. Duplicates are blocked, alerted on Slack + Teams, and logged. Unique invoices are registered, pushed to your ERP, approval-routed, and confirmed.\n\n### Setup Checklist\n1. Set your Google Sheet ID in all **Google Sheets** nodes (`YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID`)\n2. Create tabs: `PaidInvoices` and `DuplicateLog` with columns: fingerprint, vendorName, invoiceNumber, amount, currency, invoiceDate, poNumber, costCenter, riskFlag, approvalStatus, registeredAt, paid_date, payment_ref\n3. Add **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential\n4. Add **Slack** credential \u2192 set `YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID`\n5. Add **Gmail** credential \u2192 set `YOUR_APPROVER_EMAIL`\n6. Set `YOUR_TEAMS_INCOMING_WEBHOOK_URL` in the MS Teams node\n7. Set `YOUR_ERP_API_URL` + `YOUR_ERP_API_KEY` in the ERP Push node\n8. Set `YOUR_OCR_API_URL` + `YOUR_OCR_API_KEY` in the OCR node (for PDF intake)\n9. Adjust approval threshold in **Prepare Approval** (default: 5000)\n10. Activate the workflow"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "ffa54580-260f-40e0-abcf-8efeff4c28f1",
      "name": "Path A Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        416,
        32
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 380,
        "content": "## Path A \u2014 JSON Webhook Intake\nStandard intake: your AP or ERP system POSTs a JSON invoice payload directly to this webhook endpoint."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a863c77c-8336-49da-9701-e5e4d5c515ab",
      "name": "Path B Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        416,
        592
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 380,
        "height": 176,
        "content": "## Path B \u2014 PDF / OCR Intake\nAlternate intake: POST a scanned PDF invoice to this second webhook. The OCR node extracts structured fields, which are then merged with the JSON path and parsed identically."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b718c759-045b-4760-bbbf-2b989cb291b3",
      "name": "Step 1 Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        864,
        32
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 420,
        "height": 732,
        "content": "## Step 1 \u00b7 Parse & Validate\nNormalizes all fields from either intake path into a consistent fingerprint. Drops records missing vendor identity, invoice number, or a positive amount."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "7a3082fd-cb0f-4a4c-8991-c6cc783aa8c3",
      "name": "Step 2 Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1312,
        32
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 480,
        "height": 732,
        "content": "## Step 2 \u00b7 Duplicate Detection\nFingerprint is looked up in the paid-invoice register.\n\n**Duplicate path (true):** Slack alert + Teams card + Audit log entry\n\n**Unique path (false):** Continue to registration"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "c8b8a655-046a-4c96-85ed-0e6cf176472e",
      "name": "Step 3 Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1840,
        32
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1552,
        "height": 1036,
        "content": "## Step 3 \u00b7 Register & Route\nUnique invoices are appended to the register and pushed to ERP simultaneously. High-value invoices trigger a manager approval email; others get a Slack cleared notice. All paths respond to the caller."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
